---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={"HydraFacial in South Ealing | Life Spa London"} description={"HydraFacial at Life Spa London, South Ealing. Cleanse, exfoliate, extract and hydrate in one treatment, from £149, with no downtime."} style={3} page="hydrafacial">
<main id="main">

  <!-- 1. Hero -->
  <section class="hero hero--service" aria-label="HydraFacial">
    <img class="hero-img" src="assets/treatment-lauren.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="wrap hero-content">
      <p class="crumbs"><a href="index-v3.html#offer">Treatments</a> / <a href="#">Facials &amp; Skin</a> / HydraFacial</p>
      <h1>HydraFacial</h1>
      <p class="sub">Cleanse, exfoliate, extract and hydrate in one treatment. Skin looks clearer and brighter straight away, with no downtime.</p>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li>From £149</li><li>30–60 min</li><li>No downtime</li><li>All skin types</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--light" href="#">Book HydraFacial</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost-light" href="#prices">See prices</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. What it does -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose has-img">
      <h2>What HydraFacial does</h2>
      <p>HydraFacial is done with a patented device rather than by hand. Its Vortex-Fusion technology clears pores with gentle suction while it feeds serums into the skin. It's ideal for congestion, dullness, dehydration and fine lines.</p>
      <figure class="prose-img"><img src="assets/hydrafacial-device.webp" alt="HydraFacial device treatment in progress" loading="lazy"></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. Steps -->
  <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="steps-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head"><h2 id="steps-h">The steps</h2></div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3s6 6.2 6 10.5A6 6 0 0 1 6 13.5C6 9.2 12 3 12 3z"/><path d="M9.5 14a2.6 2.6 0 0 0 2.5 2.4"/></svg></div>
          <span class="n">Step 1</span>
          <h3>Cleanse and exfoliate</h3>
          <p>Water-based exfoliation lifts dead skin to reveal fresh skin underneath.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 1.8 3h10.4A2 2 0 0 0 19 18l-5-9V3"/><path d="M7.5 15h9"/></svg></div>
          <span class="n">Step 2</span>
          <h3>Peel</h3>
          <p>A gentle acid peel loosens dirt and oil, without visible peeling.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 12m-1 0a1 1 0 1 0 2 0a1 1 0 1 0-2 0"/><path d="M12 8a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 6 6 0 0 1-6 6 8 8 0 0 1-8-8 10 10 0 0 1 10-8"/></svg></div>
          <span class="n">Step 3</span>
          <h3>Extract</h3>
          <p>Painless vortex suction clears blackheads and blocked pores.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5.5c0 4.4-2.9 8-7 9.5-4.1-1.5-7-5.100-7-9.500V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
          <span class="n">Step 4</span>
          <h3>Hydrate and protect</h3>
          <p>Antioxidants, peptides and hyaluronic acid plump and protect the skin.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="step-note">Platinum starts with lymphatic drainage. Deluxe and Platinum finish with LED light therapy.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. Why clients choose it + how it compares -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap suits">
      <div>
        <h2>Why clients choose it</h2>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>A visible glow after one treatment, ideal before an event</li>
          <li>No downtime, so you can go straight back to your day</li>
          <li>Suits all skin types, including sensitive skin, after a quick consultation</li>
          <li>Verified HydraFacial provider</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="compare">
        <h3>How it compares</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Choose HydraFacial</strong> for clear pores and an instant glow, before an event or as a monthly reset.</li>
          <li><strong>Choose Environ instead</strong> for long-term change in ageing, sun damage or pigmentation.</li>
          <li><strong>Choose CACI instead</strong> if firmness or jowls are your main concern.</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="link-arrow" href="#">Compare all our facials</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. Treatments and prices -->
  <section class="section section--tint" id="prices">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:900px">
      <div class="section-head"><h2>Treatments and prices</h2></div>

      <h3 class="group-title">Face</h3>
      <div class="accordion">
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a1" id="ab1"><span class="acc-title">Signature HydraFacial</span><span class="acc-time">30 min</span><span class="acc-price">£149</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="a1" role="region" aria-labelledby="ab1"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Our express treatment: cleanse, peel, extract and hydrate. Perfect for your first HydraFacial or a quick refresh.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a2" id="ab2"><span class="acc-title">Deluxe HydraFacial</span><span class="acc-time">45 min</span><span class="acc-price">£199</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="a2" role="region" aria-labelledby="ab2"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Everything in the Signature, plus a booster serum chosen for your skin and a finishing LED light therapy.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a3" id="ab3"><span class="acc-title">Platinum HydraFacial</span><span class="acc-time">60 min</span><span class="acc-price">£249</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="a3" role="region" aria-labelledby="ab3"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Our most complete HydraFacial. It starts with lymphatic drainage to reduce puffiness, then the full Deluxe treatment and LED.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="group-title">Lip and Eye</h3>
      <div class="accordion">
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a4" id="ab4"><span class="acc-title">Perk Lip</span><span class="acc-time"></span><span class="acc-price" style="font-size:.9rem">Ask us</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="a4" role="region" aria-labelledby="ab4"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Exfoliates and hydrates for smoother, fuller-looking lips. Includes a take-home lip serum.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a5" id="ab5"><span class="acc-title">Perk Eye</span><span class="acc-time"></span><span class="acc-price" style="font-size:.9rem">Ask us</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="a5" role="region" aria-labelledby="ab5"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Brightens and hydrates the under-eye area and reduces the look of puffiness. Includes a take-home eye serum.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="group-title">Scalp</h3>
      <div class="accordion">
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a6" id="ab6"><span class="acc-title">HydraFacial Keravive</span><span class="acc-time">45 min</span><span class="acc-price" style="font-size:.9rem">Ask us</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="a6" role="region" aria-labelledby="ab6"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Cleanses, exfoliates and hydrates the scalp, then infuses peptides to support fuller, healthier-looking hair.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. Real results.
       Stand-in photos (assets/demo-result-*.jpg, "before" is the same photo filtered).
       Replace each pair with Jo's real before/after photos, using separate before and after files. -->
  <section class="section" id="results">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head"><h2>Real results</h2></div>
      <div class="ba-grid">
        <figure class="ba" style="margin:0">
          <div class="ba-box">
            <img src="assets/demo-result-1.jpg" alt="Skin after treatment" loading="lazy">
            <img class="ba-before demo" src="assets/demo-result-1.jpg" alt="Skin before treatment" loading="lazy">
            <span class="ba-label b">Before</span><span class="ba-label a">After</span>
            <div class="ba-handle"></div>
            <input class="ba-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Drag to compare before and after">
          </div>
          <figcaption>After one Deluxe HydraFacial</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="ba" style="margin:0">
          <div class="ba-box">
            <img src="assets/demo-result-2.jpg" alt="Skin after treatment" loading="lazy">
            <img class="ba-before demo" src="assets/demo-result-2.jpg" alt="Skin before treatment" loading="lazy">
            <span class="ba-label b">Before</span><span class="ba-label a">After</span>
            <div class="ba-handle"></div>
            <input class="ba-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Drag to compare before and after">
          </div>
          <figcaption>After one Signature HydraFacial</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="ba" style="margin:0">
          <div class="ba-box">
            <img src="assets/demo-result-3.jpg" alt="Skin after treatment" loading="lazy">
            <img class="ba-before demo" src="assets/demo-result-3.jpg" alt="Skin before treatment" loading="lazy">
            <span class="ba-label b">Before</span><span class="ba-label a">After</span>
            <div class="ba-handle"></div>
            <input class="ba-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Drag to compare before and after">
          </div>
          <figcaption>After one Platinum HydraFacial</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 7. Before you book -->
  <section class="section section--tint" id="before-you-book">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:860px">
      <div class="section-head"><h2>Before you book</h2></div>
      <div class="accordion">
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="b1" id="bb1"><span class="acc-title">Is HydraFacial right for me?</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="b1" role="region" aria-labelledby="bb1"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Please tell us before booking if any of these apply, and your therapist will confirm what's suitable: pregnancy or breastfeeding; active rashes, sunburn, cold sores or broken skin; isotretinoin (Roaccutane) in the last 6 months; prescription retinoids; an allergy to aspirin or salicylates; injectables or laser in the last 2 weeks.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="b2" id="bb2"><span class="acc-title">How often should I have it?</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="b2" role="region" aria-labelledby="bb2"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>For best results, once a month.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="b3" id="bb3"><span class="acc-title">Does it hurt?</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="b3" role="region" aria-labelledby="bb3"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>No. Most people find it relaxing. It feels like a cool, gentle suction.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="b4" id="bb4"><span class="acc-title">Can I wear make-up afterwards?</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="b4" role="region" aria-labelledby="bb4"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Yes, though leaving your skin bare for the rest of the day gets the most from the serums.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 8. Book -->
  <section class="cta" id="book">
    <div class="wrap cta-split">
      <figure class="cta-img"><img src="assets/hydrafacial-cta.jpg" alt="HydraFacial therapist with a client" loading="lazy"></figure>
      <div class="cta-body">
        <h2>Ready to glow?</h2>
        <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn" href="#">Book HydraFacial</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost-light" href="tel:+442085675159">Call 020 8567 5159</a>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</Base>
